      width: 224.00006
      height: 285.3333
    title: "\u53C2\u6570\u7684\u5916\u90E8\u4EA4\u4E92"
    content: "\u901A\u8FC7Fsm\u64AD\u653E\u5668\u6765\u83B7\u53D6\u5F53\u524D\u53C2\u6570\u3002\n\n\u83B7\u53D6\u65B9\u6CD5\uFF1A\nFsmObjectBase.TryGetInt()\n\r\rFsmObjectBase.TryGetFloat()\nFsmObjectBase.TryGetBool()\nFsmObjectBase.TryGetString()\nFsmObjectBase.TryGetVector4()\nFsmObjectBase.TryGetColor()\n\n\u8BBE\u7F6E\u65B9\u6CD5\uFF1A\nFsmObjectBase.SetInt()\nFsmObjectBase.SetFloat()\nFsmObjectBase.SetBool()\nFsmObjectBase.SetString()\nFsmObjectBase.SetVector4()\nFsmObjectBase.SetColor()"
